<section class='jj-rd-config jj-characteristics-config jj-resistances-config'>
    <header class='jj-rd-config-header'>
        <h2>Resistências</h2>
        <p>Selecione as resistências ativas. As resistências base usam os mesmos tipos de dano de RDs e indicam que a personagem recebe apenas 50% desse dano.</p>
    </header>

    <div class='jj-rd-config-list jj-resistances-config-list'>
        {{#if resistanceDefinitions.length}}
            {{#each resistanceDefinitions as |resistance|}}
                <div class='jj-rd-config-row jj-resistances-config-row {{#if resistance.enabled}}is-enabled{{/if}}' data-resistance-row>
                    <label class='jj-rd-config-main' for='jj-resistance-enabled-{{resistance.id}}'>
                        <input
                            id='jj-resistance-enabled-{{resistance.id}}'
                            class='jj-rd-config-toggle'
                            data-resistance-enabled
                            type='checkbox'
                            name='{{resistance.selectionName}}'
                            {{checked resistance.selected}}
                        />
                        <span class='jj-rd-config-code'>{{resistance.code}}</span>
                        <span class='jj-rd-config-text'>
                            <strong>{{resistance.label}}</strong>
                            <span>{{resistance.summary}}</span>
                        </span>
                    </label>
                </div>
            {{/each}}
        {{else}}
            <p class='jj-rd-empty'>Nenhuma resistência custom criada ainda.</p>
        {{/if}}
    </div>

    <section class='jj-characteristics-custom-section'>
        <div class='jj-rd-heading'>
            <h3>Resistências Custom</h3>
        </div>
        <div class='jj-characteristics-custom-list' data-resistances-custom-list data-next-index='{{customResistances.length}}'>
            {{#each customResistances as |resistance idx|}}
                <div class='jj-characteristics-custom-row' data-custom-resistance-row>
                    <input type='hidden' name='custom.{{idx}}.id' value='{{resistance.id}}' />
                    <input type='hidden' name='custom.{{idx}}.origem' value='custom' />
                    <div class='jj-characteristics-custom-grid'>
                        <label class='jj-characteristics-custom-field'>
                            <span>Nome</span>
                            <input name='custom.{{idx}}.label' type='text' value='{{resistance.label}}' />
                        </label>
                        <label class='jj-characteristics-custom-field'>
                            <span>Sigla</span>
                            <input name='custom.{{idx}}.code' type='text' value='{{resistance.code}}' maxlength='6' placeholder='RES' />
                        </label>
                        <label class='jj-characteristics-custom-field jj-characteristics-custom-field--wide'>
                            <span>Descrição</span>
                            <textarea name='custom.{{idx}}.description' rows='2'>{{resistance.description}}</textarea>
                        </label>
                        <label class='jj-characteristics-custom-field jj-characteristics-custom-field--wide'>
                            <span>Observações</span>
                            <textarea name='custom.{{idx}}.observations' rows='2'>{{resistance.observations}}</textarea>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                    <div class='jj-characteristics-custom-actions'>
                        <button class='jj-action-button jj-action-button--danger' type='button' data-remove-custom-resistance>Remover custom</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{/each}}
        </div>
        <div class='jj-characteristics-custom-toolbar'>
            <button class='jj-action-button' type='button' data-add-custom-resistance>Adicionar Resistência Custom</button>
            <button class='jj-action-button jj-action-button--primary' type='button' data-save-resistances>Salvar e adicionar à ficha</button>
        </div>
        <p class='jj-characteristics-custom-note'>As resistências custom são salvas na configuração própria de Resistências e já entram ativas ao serem adicionadas.</p>
    </section>
</section>
